rawosd.conf(5)

# NAME

rawosd.conf - rawosd transient presentation configuration

# DESCRIPTION

rawosd configuration uses libconfig syntax. The schema contains presentation
policy only. Unknown settings and settings with the wrong type fail validation.

The stock file is */etc/rawosd/rawosd.conf*. Unless *rawosd -c* is used, a
per-user file may layer over it as described in *rawosd*(1).

# TOP-LEVEL SETTINGS

*font* = _string_
	Xft/Fontconfig pattern. Must not be empty. Default: *monospace:size=9*.

*position* = *"top"* | *"bottom"*
	Place the surface relative to the full rawm monitor rectangle. Default:
	*"bottom"*.

*geometry* = _boolean_
	Render live move and resize feedback. Default: *false*.

*duration\_ms* = _integer_
	Visibility duration, from 100 through 5000 milliseconds. Default: 800.

*padding* = _integer_
	Text padding in pixels, from 0 through 256. Default: 10.

*offset* = _integer_
	Distance from the selected top or bottom monitor edge, from 0 through 4096
	pixels. Default: 24.

*min\_width* = _integer_
	Minimum surface width in pixels, from 0 through 8192. Default: 0.

# COLORS

The *colors* group accepts *normal* and *floating*. Each group accepts:

*foreground* = _string_
	Xft text color.

*background* = _string_
	Surface background color.

*accent* = _string_
	Color of the small bottom marker.

The stock normal and floating schemes use white text on *#0066ff* with the same
blue accent. The floating scheme is selected for live geometry and the elevated
state of a floating client; other events use the normal scheme.

# LAYOUT SYMBOLS

The *layouts* group owns presentation labels for rawm's stable layout IDs:

- *tile*
- *floating*
- *monocle*
- *bstack*
- *bstack\_horizontal*
- *grid*

Each symbol is at most 32 bytes. Stock values are *[]=*, *<1/1>*, *[1/1]*,
*TTT*, *===*, and *###* respectively.

# EXAMPLE

```
font = "monospace:size=10";
position = "top";
geometry = true;
duration_ms = 1000;
padding = 8;
offset = 16;
min_width = 160;

colors = {
  normal = {
    foreground = "#ffffff";
    background = "#0066ff";
    accent = "#0066ff";
  };
  floating = {
    foreground = "#ffffff";
    background = "#0055dd";
    accent = "#ffffff";
  };
};

layouts = {
  tile = "[]=";
  floating = "<1/1>";
  monocle = "[1/1]";
  bstack = "TTT";
  bstack_horizontal = "===";
  grid = "###";
};
```

# SEE ALSO

*rawosd*(1), *rawm*(1)
